{"steam_appid":1388870,"steam_name":"Arcade Paradise","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1388870/494782/b688e5047e8f122bdf4aaa8cf7b2bee82a1487e6/1751231298/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1662649976","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256904978/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1662649976","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/ss_d2367fbcc3a35c7ca7bd2cdd77b82454348430d3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782220777","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/ss_c3f3ab690c116a9f3b32db98e42d285305ffccd9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782220777","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/ss_6292fdf98da3ce1cabdc382cc930d648441781ca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782220777","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/ss_1361e27676b8ef943783593c36ab64c8fe68ab66.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782220777","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/ss_6efa9b45733d84090f669b653cf84abef47884b9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782220777"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Arcade Paradise, the 90’s-fuelled retro arcade adventure. Rather than washing rags for a living, you decide to turn the family laundromat into the ultimate arcade. Play, profit, and purchase new arcade machines, with over 35 to choose from, to build your very own Arcade Paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/43b9edeae07884e7b038f6abcf841a2c.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/43b9edeae07884e7b038f6abcf841a2c.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/43b9edeae07884e7b038f6abcf841a2c.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the laundromat business made up of dull chores from washing clothes to throwing out the trash, and turn it into a booming arcade with the coolest games in town raking in all the money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd451eb67dd2aad8d40d3c6f9549100a.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd451eb67dd2aad8d40d3c6f9549100a.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd451eb67dd2aad8d40d3c6f9549100a.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/f78055df794dfdd4b0d91836eebce2d1.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/f78055df794dfdd4b0d91836eebce2d1.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/f78055df794dfdd4b0d91836eebce2d1.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 35 arcade games, each fully realized with its own gameplay, stories, missions, and high scores to set! Inspired by 3 decades of gaming, from early vector games right up to the 32-bit era. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/036eab1923533824019452e4a28a931a.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/036eab1923533824019452e4a28a931a.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/036eab1923533824019452e4a28a931a.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/0d8c07edefa4c3e9fbe5765443edd306.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/0d8c07edefa4c3e9fbe5765443edd306.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/0d8c07edefa4c3e9fbe5765443edd306.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insert a second coin and play against a friend in a number of co-operative &amp; competitive arcade games with up to 4 players locally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/86804d5f2ffb7c7cc90b1523465962f7.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/86804d5f2ffb7c7cc90b1523465962f7.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/86804d5f2ffb7c7cc90b1523465962f7.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/dff0df82c77ebc0c30505a98c9c714bb.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/dff0df82c77ebc0c30505a98c9c714bb.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/dff0df82c77ebc0c30505a98c9c714bb.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove yourself across each game, set your high scores, make your favourite arcade game more popular and upload to the online leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/da83e05562b7b9e29852920805db02a3.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/da83e05562b7b9e29852920805db02a3.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/da83e05562b7b9e29852920805db02a3.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/6da3fa6da80340a87a309598c71852ff.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/6da3fa6da80340a87a309598c71852ff.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/6da3fa6da80340a87a309598c71852ff.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the individual games to choosing what song to put on the jukebox inspired by some of the great records of the early 90s, the soundtrack captures the heart of a bygone era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/8062592fd6beba45bdcc36e0a67ab515.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/8062592fd6beba45bdcc36e0a67ab515.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/8062592fd6beba45bdcc36e0a67ab515.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/e7efa40bffed384439cb3df7ad08a0af.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/e7efa40bffed384439cb3df7ad08a0af.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/e7efa40bffed384439cb3df7ad08a0af.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello 90’s. If you could smell this game, it would smell like memories. Everything from the look and feel of the arcades, to using the latest PC connected to the mind-blowing dial-up connection, all have been recreated with pure love. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/71e350a51ec880d4aab50f8193fe63d6.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/71e350a51ec880d4aab50f8193fe63d6.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/71e350a51ec880d4aab50f8193fe63d6.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd5f6638050c86c3f0951afedca45957.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd5f6638050c86c3f0951afedca45957.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd5f6638050c86c3f0951afedca45957.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doug Cockle (famous for his voice acting in Victor Vran and The Witcher series) plays the role of Ashley’s berating father. Being too busy in the Riviera to see King Wash for himself, you will receive many phone calls from Gerald sharing his wise words of advice and constant reminders to fix the toilet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/181f542304a4ccba7b3cf0d81b868c00.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/181f542304a4ccba7b3cf0d81b868c00.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/181f542304a4ccba7b3cf0d81b868c00.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 32bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660, AMD Radeon HD 6770<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Microsoft Xbox Controller for Windows® (or equivalent) is recommended.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Nosebleed Interactive"],"publishers":["Wired Productions"],"release_date":"11 Aug, 2022"}